# Optional machine-only overrides — NOT the network stack.
#
#   Devnet  → .env.devnet   (npm run dev:devnet, npm run solver:htlc, …)
#   Mainnet → .env.mainnet  (npm run dev:mainnet, npm run solver:htlc:mainnet, …)
#
# Do NOT copy Supabase, Keycloak, HTLC_DAEMON_SECRET, NEXT_PUBLIC_NETWORK, or
# other stack vars here. Next.js loads .env.local automatically; duplicates
# cause wrong-network bugs and intermittent daemon 401s.
#
# Safe examples (uncomment if needed):
# ALLOW_TOKEN_LEAK=true
# TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS=1
